  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a skillet over medium heat",
    "Add the chili powder, cumin, and coriander and sauté for 1 minute until fragrant",
    "Stir in the tamarind paste, honey, and lemon juice until the mixture thickens slightly",
    "Add the shredded cheddar and feta cheese, cooking until the cheese begins to melt",
    "Fold in the roasted almonds and yogurt, stirring until fully incorporated",
    "Transfer the mixture to a lacquerware bowl and drizzle with tahini",
    "Season with sea salt to taste",
    "Serve immediately while the cheese is still gooey"
